        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fairview_Park%2C_Ohio"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Fairview Park Historical Society, founded in 1984, collects artifacts and hosts lectures to keep the city’s past alive.",
